
                                                   CONFIG SPLIT REF COMMAND


	Config Split Ref implements the split functionality.


-----------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
SWITCHES               |    DESCRIPTION
-----------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   -core_exp           |    File which contains the path of merged_corecfg_export.xml.
   -in_t               |    Template input XML file.
   -split_in           |    Input XML file for split.
   -split_in_ref       |    Reference input XML file for split.
   -rule_t             |    Template rules XML file.
   -split_rule         |    Splits the rules XML file.
   -out_t              |    Template output XML file.
   -split_out          |    Output XML file for Split.
   -split_out_ref      |    Reference output XML file for Split .
   -hex_split_in       |    Input HEX file for split.
   -ref_hex            |    Refernce HEX file.
   -info_blks          |    lst file for Infoblock cmp.
   -hex_cmp_dir        |    Points the directory for cmp.
   -hexmod_split_log   |    Log file for hexmodx split functionality.
   -logfile            |    Log file for Config-HexmodX.
   -hexmod18           |    To identify it is MDG1 project.   
-----------------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Example:

--split_ref_func    
--core_exp         _gen/swb/module/coreproc/filelist_gen_merged_exp.txt
--in_t             _gen/swb/module/hexmod/INPUT.XT
--split_in         _gen/swb/module/hexmod/input_hexcompare.xml
--split_in_ref     _gen/swb/module/hexmod/input_hexcompare_ref.xml
--rule_t           _gen/swb/module/hexmod/RULES.XT
--split_rule       _gen/swb/module/hexmod/rules_hexcompare.xml
--out_t            _gen/swb/module/hexmod/OUTPUT.XT
--split_out        _gen/swb/module/hexmod/output_hexcompare.xml
--split_out_ref    _gen/swb/module/hexmod/output_hexcompare_ref.xml
--hex_split_in     _gen/swb/module/hexmod/R4Cx800xB_tmp.hex
--ref_hex          MAK/MakeWare/pver_ref_prj.hex
--info_blks        _gen/swb/module/hexmod/hex_compare/tmp/info_blks_cmp.lst
--hex_cmp_dir      _gen/swb/module/hexmod/hex_compare/tmp
--hexmod_split_log _log/swb/module/hexmod/hexmod_hexcompare.log
--logfile          _log/swb/module/hexmod/config_hexmod_hexcompare.log
--hexmod18    